      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "We turned into a bureaucracy with an intelligence collection outfit attached to it as an appendage and mostly getting in",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 4526
        }
      ],
      "words": 54
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Oh, no doubt. But where does that PDB stuff come from? Not from CIA. We hardly do our own damned collection anymore at a",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5431
        }
      ],
      "words": 55
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "They're not first-rate, they're not even second-rate. They're third- and fourth-rate. But their second cousin recommende",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6835
        }
      ],
      "words": 47
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I guess you might say I'm the Ghost of CIA Past. And the sad fact is, the Pickle Factory hasn't been the Pickle Factory ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 8464
        }
      ],
      "words": 29
    },
    {
      "block": "原句8",
      "no": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Yep, OXCART. Archangel. A-12. R-12. And YF-12, M-21, RS-71, SR-71, Habu, Cygnus, Blackbird, and SR, too. Or as the pilot",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 9257
        }
      ],
      "words": 48
    },
    {
      "block": "原句9",
      "no": 9,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Something called GOOWIKI. Another stab at large-scale, nonofficial, outside-of-station deployments. I'm helping come up ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 11425
        }
      ],
      "words": 39
    },
    {
      "block": "原句10",
      "no": 10,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "But that's the year Wacker came on board, 1977. I remember because I was serving a rotation as an instructor then, and h",
